⸻

Opus Workflow

We built a full “Intake → Understand → Decide → Review → Deliver” automation in Opus.
	•	Intake: user text input
	•	Understand: NNF Generator (custom agent)
	•	Decide: validation + rules + agentic review
	•	Review: human review with schema checks
	•	Deliver: structured JSON output

Opus Workflow (Public Template Link)
https://app.opus.com/app/workflow/share/30455570-d049-4e60-90f2-e1a600f6885a
